{"unit_id":"yingchaoyi__dsh-sticker-vault#caveat-caveat-1","repo":"yingchaoyi/dsh-sticker-vault","commit":"1d018a1942f03b146bab7cd1b5117eb7ba1afafe","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sticker-vault 使用前须知：启用自动描述时，插件会将图片及其聊天语境提交给 DSH 当前默认模型；该功能可关闭，README 所称不调模型与源码行为不一致。（见 lib/index.mjs:713-760）","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.mjs:713-760"]}
